<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman on Bedford Property.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman on Bedford Property.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Bedford Property Investors Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $23.</p>
<p>-- The stock was flat at 17-5/8.</p>
